  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Target:</strong> A magical effect.</p>\n<p>You impose a -1 penalty to the effect’s caster level (to a minimum caster level of 1), and a -4 penalty to any concentration checks made as part of the magical effect—these penalties increase by 1 for every 4 associated ranks you possess. Additionally, the caster of the effect (if any) is treated as though they lost a spell by failing a concentration check for the purposes of abilities reliant on it (such as the Invasive Hacking talent).</p>\n<p>Also, the magical effect becomes unwieldy to control; any actions that the effect requires to maintain, redirect, or otherwise alter the effect during its duration (such as moving an Energy Sphere or dismissing a spell) are increased by one step (swift &gt; move &gt; standard &gt; full-round action &gt; 1 round).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellhacking#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
